Page Object Model – POM
POM ka simple meaning hai:

Har webpage ki information aur us webpage par perform hone wale actions ko ek separate class mein rakhna.

For example:
Class	Responsibility
BaseTest	Browser manage karna
LoginPage	Login page ke elements/actions
InventoryPage	Products page ke elements/actions
InventoryTest	Products page test karna
LoginTest	Login functionality test karna

Remember this simple rule
- BaseTest = Browser kaun manage karega?
- Page classes = Website par kaam kaise hoga?
- Test classes = Kya verify karna hai?